        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: The Warlock in Spite of Himself; Le Médecin malgré lui\n- People: Molière; Jean-Baptiste Poquelin\n- Topics: title allusions; French literature; comedy\n\nFacts:\n- Molière was the stage name of Jean-Baptiste Poquelin, a French playwright and actor born on 15 January 1622 and died on 17 February 1673.\n- Molière is considered one of the greatest masters of comedy in Western literature.\n- The title of The Warlock in Spite of Himself is a play on the title of Molière's Le Médecin malgré lui, translated as The Doctor, in Spite of Himself.",
